#: ../../user-guide/point-of-sale.rst:5
msgid "Point of Sale"
msgstr ""

#: ../../user-guide/point-of-sale.rst:9
msgid "On this page:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../user-guide/point-of-sale.rst:15
msgid "Configure Taler payment for point of sale"
msgstr ""

#: ../../user-guide/point-of-sale.rst:17
msgid ""
"Allowing Taler payment on the point-of-sale app requires a few more steps"
" than regular online payments."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user-guide/point-of-sale.rst:18
msgid "Preliminary steps:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../user-guide/point-of-sale.rst:20
msgid ""
"Have previously :ref:`setup Taler as a payment provider <payment-"
"provider-configuration>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user-guide/point-of-sale.rst:23
msgid "Install the ``Point of sale`` Odoo app."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user-guide/point-of-sale.rst:25
msgid "Create the Point of Sale payment method:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../user-guide/point-of-sale.rst:27
msgid "On the top bar, press ``Configuration -> Payment Methods``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user-guide/point-of-sale.rst:28
msgid "Create a new Payment Method."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user-guide/point-of-sale.rst:30
msgid ""
"Name it ``Taler`` (You can call it something else, but ``Taler`` is "
"easier to keep track of)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user-guide/point-of-sale.rst:32
msgid "Check the ``Online Payment`` checkbox."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user-guide/point-of-sale.rst:33
msgid "Select ``Taler`` in the ``Allowed Providers`` field."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user-guide/point-of-sale.rst:35
msgid "Add Taler to the point of sale:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../user-guide/point-of-sale.rst:37
msgid "Make sure that the point of sale register is closed for this step."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user-guide/point-of-sale.rst:38
msgid ""
"On the top bar, press ``Configuration -> Point of Sales``, you will be "
"redirected to the point of sale list."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user-guide/point-of-sale.rst:40
msgid "Select the point of sale you’d like to add Taler payment to."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user-guide/point-of-sale.rst:41
msgid ""
"Click on ``More settings: Configurations > Settings``, which will lead "
"you to the point of sale’s settings page."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user-guide/point-of-sale.rst:44
msgid ""
"Alternatively, you can access this page by going to Settings through the "
"app switcher (top-left button), then going to ``Point of Sale`` section, "
"and selecting the point of sale that you would like to modify."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user-guide/point-of-sale.rst:49
msgid ""
"In ``Payment -> Payment Methods``, add the payment method you just "
"created (generally ``Taler``)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user-guide/point-of-sale.rst:52
msgid ""
"The setup is now complete, and you can select this new payment provider "
"when a customer pay for an order on the Point of sale that you added the "
"payment method to."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user-guide/point-of-sale.rst:59
msgid "Pay using Taler at a Point of Sale"
msgstr ""

#: ../../user-guide/point-of-sale.rst:61
msgid ""
"Open a register on one of the Points of Sale for which you have activated"
" the Taler payment method."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user-guide/point-of-sale.rst:63
msgid ""
"Add any items to the order and click ``Payment`` at the bottom of the "
"page."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user-guide/point-of-sale.rst:65
msgid "Select the payment method ``Taler`` payment method."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user-guide/point-of-sale.rst:-1
msgid "Taler pos taler payment"
msgstr ""

#: ../../user-guide/point-of-sale.rst:-1
msgid ".. image:: ../images/EN/Taler_pos_taler_payment.png"
msgstr ".. image:: ../images/FR/Taler_pos_taler_payment.png"

#: ../../user-guide/point-of-sale.rst:72
msgid "Click ``Validate``, it will show a QR Code."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user-guide/point-of-sale.rst:73
msgid ""
"Scanning this QR Code will redirect to an Odoo page, where the customer "
"will be able to pay with Taler."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user-guide/point-of-sale.rst:75
msgid ""
"This will bring the customer to a Taler order page, and they will be able"
" to pay using their Taler wallet or web browser."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user-guide/point-of-sale.rst:77
msgid ""
"Upon payment completion, the customer will be redirected to Odoo, with a "
"confirmation of payment."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user-guide/point-of-sale.rst:-1
msgid "Taler pos payment complete"
msgstr ""

#: ../../user-guide/point-of-sale.rst:-1
msgid ".. image:: ../images/EN/Taler_pos_payment_complete.png"
msgstr ".. image:: ../images/FR/Taler_pos_payment_complete.png"

#: ../../user-guide/point-of-sale.rst:85
msgid ""
"The point of sale's side will show a successful payment, and produce a "
"receipt."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user-guide/point-of-sale.rst:-1
msgid "Taler pos receipt"
msgstr ""

#: ../../user-guide/point-of-sale.rst:-1
msgid ".. image:: ../images/EN/Taler_pos_receipt.png"
msgstr ".. image:: ../images/FR/Taler_pos_receipt.png"

